Cell["At some phase-space \
points, the Higgs contact and exchange terms nearly cancel. On a saved point where the CalcHEP \
comparison exceeded its 10^-7 tolerance, replaying the same generated evaluator and inputs at 113-bit \
precision reduced the relative difference from 1.74 x 10^-7 to 1.34 x 10^-11. An independent symbolic \
comparison gave zero difference. The size of the numerical residual can vary across platforms and \
builds.", "Text", CellTags -> "hepcat-hhhh-extended-precision-replay", ExpressionUUID ->
             "fac7c0bb-6812-4d5c-9d8e-396c3d9de410"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Closed]],

