Cell["Ten four-gluon helicity amplitudes vanish analytically. Numerical \
evaluation of the cancellations can leave a tiny residual. The MadGraph validator applies a 10^-22 \
absolute bound to exported exact-zero helicities and reports the measured residual and bound. The six \
nonzero helicities use the ordinary comparison.", "Text", CellTags -> "hepcat-gluon-exact-zero-replay",
            ExpressionUUID -> "d78619a2-e3b4-4cd6-b434-be445d2c6fc4"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Closed]],

